{
  "ID": "GoR_Prologue_AmbushConvoy_MidnightHarvest",
  "contractName": "Midnight Harvest",
  "contractDisplayStyle": "BaseCampaignNormal",
  "difficulty": 3,
  "difficultyUIModifier": 0,
  "weight": 1,
  "scope": "STANDARD",
  "finalDifficulty": 0,
  "shortDescription": "Commander {COMMANDER.Callsign},\n\nA target of interest is currently moving through a low-traffic sector under minimal escort. This presents a rare window to eliminate it before it reaches secure territory. Your mission is to intercept and destroy the convoy. Swiftly, quietly, and without attracting unnecessary attention.\n\nBe advised: rapid-response forces are stationed nearby. A drop too large will trigger an immediate alarm. This operation demands precision. Deploy only a small, fast strike group, neutralize the targets, and extract before reinforcements mobilize.\n\nThere will be no questions, no debrief, and no salvage rights. None. Compensation will be delivered via direct C-bill transfer outside standard MRBC channels. You will receive <b>three million</b> c-bills total, a sum that includes a significant bonus in return for your discretion in not reporting this operation through official channels.\n\nThis is a closed-loop assignment. Accept. Execute. Move on.\n\n-Mizuki Bekker\n\n<color=red>Contract Restrictions: Maximum of 4 units and 280 total tons. No individual unit may exceed 70 tons.</color>",
  "longDescription": "Commander, this contract reeks. No salvage, payment outside the system, limited forces, and vague targets. Something's definitely off. But the payout? It's well above standard. We might be walking into a trap, or something bigger. Still, with that kind of money, it's hard to say no. Proceed cautiously.",
  "salvagePotential": 0,
